204
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,460
It does not run ORCA.

205
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:32,800
Next, connect ORCA through an authorized MCP tool,

206
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:36,520
install ORCA separately, and deliberately choose the file

207
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,940
access and CPU resources the agent may

208
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:39,360
use.

209
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:41,460
Keep execution under your control.

210
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:44,600
Give the agent a specific scientific task.

211
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,040
Ask for a vertical

212
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,720
absorption input with 10 excited states using your

213
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,800
molecular geometry.

214
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,500
Have it check the input,

215
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:55,120
explain its choices, and ask before execution.

216
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:58,540
Extend the library one tested workflow at a

217
00:08:58,540 --> 00:08:58,900
time,

218
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:00,900
add geometry optimization,

219
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:04,100
vibrational analysis, or excited state dynamics

220
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:06,360
only after the first workflow is ready.

221
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:08,820
Check each addition before you rely on it.
